OL,3,GNEWSAFamily support centre struggling
OL,4,Ato match demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity supporting families with
OL,7,Fchildren with additional needs says
OL,8,Fdemand is already outstripping supply,
OL,9,Fjust weeks after it moved into its new
OL,10,Fhome.
OL,12,FBuilding For the Future had been based
OL,13,Fin Wokingham, Berkshire, but moved to a
OL,14,Fsite on the outskirts of Reading, just
OL,15,Fin time for the start of the summer
OL,16,Fholidays.
OL,18,FIt is now fundraising to lay on extra
OL,19,Fsessions after it was forced to turn
OL,20,Fsome families away.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
